"""R2 (NOTES.md): ProtoGLAD's own protocol, run through its official entry point verbatim.

  python -B native_repro.py --ds BZR [--attr "node attribute"]

Equivalent to `cd <run dir> && python src/run.py detect --ds_name BZR --mode search --attr <DEFAULT_ATTR_MAP[BZR]>`
(seed 42 once, its StratifiedKFold splits, minority-class anomaly, its features, its 144-cell test-AUC search, one
RNG stream through the whole search). Only change: D1 (IK CPU fallback) when no GPU is present; D5 (TQDM_DISABLE).
Run dir: $GLAD_DATA_ROOT/ext_protoglad/native/run_<DS>/ (fresh; data/ -> the copied TU raw files).
The search must run uninterrupted: ProtoGLAD's own resume skips finished cells, which shifts its RNG stream, so an
interrupted search is restarted from scratch (the run dir is wiped).
